# dist/ IS committed. mesh-serve's builder installs a site's dependencies with
# `npm ci --omit=dev --ignore-scripts`, so a git dependency's `prepare` never runs there: a tag has
# to contain the built package itself. Rebuild (`npm run build`) and commit dist/ before tagging.
